      "id": "event-01",
      "label": "The onager among the herds",
      "summary": "As Kay Khosrow feasts with Gudarz, Rostam, Giv and others, a herdsman reports an onager the colour of the sun that tears apart the stallions. The king knows it is no onager and asks Rostam to go, warning that it may be Ahriman.",
