    {
      "id": "event-02",
      "label": "The onager that vanishes",
      "summary": "Rostam searches three days and on the fourth sees it. He means to take it alive with his lasso, but it vanishes; he knows it must be the demon Akvan, and his arrow too finds nothing.",
