    {
      "id": "event-03",
      "label": "Carried off in sleep",
      "summary": "Worn out, Rostam waters Rakhsh at a spring and sleeps. Akvan comes as a wind, cuts out the ground beneath him and lifts him into the air, then asks whether he wants to be thrown onto the mountains or into the sea.",
