    {
      "id": "event-04",
      "label": "Into the sea",
      "summary": "Knowing a demon does the opposite of what is asked, Rostam asks to be thrown onto the mountain; Akvan throws him into the deep sea. Rostam draws his sword against the sea monsters and swims to land.",
