    {
      "id": "event-05",
      "label": "Rakhsh among Afrasiab’s mares",
      "summary": "Back at the spring Rakhsh is gone. Rostam follows him on foot and finds him among Afrasiab’s mares, lassoes and saddles him, drives off the herd and kills two thirds of the herdsmen’s riders.",
